    "title": "Senior Fleet Manager at Wabash National India Global Group",
    "description": "Join the Wabash National India Global Group family as a Fleet Manager in Varanasi. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout Wabash National India Global Group:\nWabash National India Global Group is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Handle customs clearance for import and export shipments\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Wabash National India Global Group!",
